{"shell.main_menu.shell-tutorial","Interactive tutorial"},
{"shell.main_menu.shell-tutorial-help","A guided first settlement: gather, dig, store, craft, farm, and build a dormitory."},
{"tutorial.explanation","Use the real settlement tools to complete this lesson. The tutorial only advances when the game state confirms it."},
{"tutorial.explanation.inspect_assign","The creature inspector changes the selected gnome's profession. The Population window lists every gnome, and its Properties command opens the same inspector. Both make the same kind of assignment."},
{"tutorial.explanation.stockpile","Build a workshop and place storage nearby. New stockpiles accept nothing until you set an Allow list rule. Allow raw wood, then link the stockpile in the workshop's Settings so the workshop can use it as a preferred source."},
{"tutorial.explanation.farming","The farm window's Plots page mirrors your farm's tiles. Select plots, or click Select All, then choose a crop and click Assign; Use Default clears that assignment. On the Plot Queue page, Queue schedules plantings for each selected plot and Queue Repeat cycles them behind later orders. Click OK or Apply to send your changes to the farm."},
{"tutorial.incompatible.title","Tutorial unavailable"},{"tutorial.incompatible.explanation","This save was created with a tutorial scenario version this build cannot guide. Your world is preserved; continue normally or restart with a current tutorial scenario."},
{"tutorial.step.orientation","Find your bearings"},{"tutorial.step.inspect_assign","Prepare a woodcutter and check supplies"},{"tutorial.step.gathering","Gather wood and food"},{"tutorial.step.mining_levels","Dig a first room"},{"tutorial.step.stockpile","Build a workshop and link storage"},{"tutorial.step.crafting","Craft your first plank"},{"tutorial.step.farming","Plan your farm"},{"tutorial.step.shelter","Give gnomes beds"},{"tutorial.step.graduation","Keep your settlement growing"},
{"tutorial.objective.orientation","Practice moving the view and controlling time before giving orders."},{"tutorial.objective.inspect_assign","Assign a Woodcutter for the first tree, then learn where to see all your raw wood."},{"tutorial.objective.gathering","Cut a nearby pine and harvest the ripe strawberry beside camp."},{"tutorial.objective.mining_levels","Mine into the ground and connect a lower level with stairs."},{"tutorial.objective.stockpile","Build a crude workbench, allow raw wood in a nearby stockpile, then link the two."},{"tutorial.objective.crafting","Order a plank at your new workbench and check the result in Inventory & Resources."},{"tutorial.objective.farming","Assign strawberry to farm plots, queue plantings for them, and watch the first seed get planted."},{"tutorial.objective.shelter","Designate a dormitory in your dug room and place the five starter beds."},{"tutorial.objective.graduation","You have the first resource loop. Keep playing this world: expand food, workshops, and safe rooms at your own pace."},
{"tutorial.steps.orientation.pan","Drag the map with the left mouse button to pan."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.wheel_level","Scroll over the map without Ctrl to move between Z levels."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.wheel_level_ctrl","Hold Ctrl and scroll over the map to move between Z levels."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.zoom","Hold Ctrl and scroll over the map to zoom in or out."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.zoom_plain","Scroll over the map without Ctrl to zoom in or out."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.rotate","Use the configured rotate controls or the rotate command when available."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.level","Click Level Down on the toolbar to view a lower level."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.pause","Click Pause on the toolbar to let time run. If time is already running, click Pause twice."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.speed","Click Fast Speed on the toolbar to change simulation speed."},
{"tutorial.steps.inspect.select","Click a gnome on the map to open its Properties window."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.inspect","Click the Skills tab. Woodcutting is a skill, and its level is shown in the list below Profession."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.population","Click Population on the toolbar. On the Citizens page, select a gnome and click Properties to review its assignments."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.inventory","Click Inventory on the toolbar. Find raw wood under Item and read Total, then open its row to see what it makes. In Stock counts only stockpiled wood."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.assignment","On this gnome's Skills tab, choose Woodcutter from the Profession list. This changes the gnome's work assignment and activates Woodcutting and other wood skills."},
{"tutorial.steps.gathering.wood","Click Agriculture on the toolbar, then Cut Tree. On the map, drag a small selection over a pine east of camp and release to mark it. If time is paused, click Pause to let it run, and wait until the tree falls."},{"tutorial.steps.gathering.food","Click Inspect on the toolbar, then click the ripe strawberry east of camp. In the Tile Properties window, click Harvest. If time is paused, click Pause to let it run, and wait for the harvest."},
{"tutorial.steps.mining.stairs","Click Mine on the toolbar, then Dig Stairs Down, and click west of camp. Wait for the first stair."},{"tutorial.steps.mining.wall","Go down one level, click Mine > Mine Walls on the toolbar, and drag a small room from the stair landing. Wait for a wall tile to be dug."},
{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.workshop","Click Build on the toolbar. In the Build window, choose Workshops, choose Wood under Material, select the crude workbench and click Build. Click clear ground south of camp to place it. If time is paused, click Pause to let it run, and wait for construction to finish."},{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.designate","Click Designations on the toolbar, then Stockpile. Drag over a small clear area beside the finished workbench and release to create storage."},{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.allow","Click your new stockpile on the map. In its Stockpile window, click the Allow list tab. Filter Item to raw wood, then click the blocked raw wood row to allow it (or click Allow matches). Pine raw wood must be allowed before gnomes will haul it here."},{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.open","Click the finished crude workbench on the map to open its Workshop window, then click the Stockpiles tab."},{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.link","Check your new stockpile in the list to link it, then click OK."},
{"tutorial.steps.crafting.recipe","In the Workshop window, click the Craft tab (click the workbench again if the window is closed). Select plank, set the quantity to 1, and click Add Order. The Queue tab shows the order."},{"tutorial.steps.crafting.collect","If time is paused, click Pause to let it run, and wait for a plank. Click Inventory on the toolbar and check its Total."},
{"tutorial.steps.farming.designate","Click Designations > Farm on the toolbar, then drag a small clear area south of camp."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.crop","Click a farm tile to open the farm's window, then click the Plots tab. Select plots or click Select All, choose strawberry, and click Assign."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.queue","Click the Plot Queue tab, set Per plot to 2, and click Queue to schedule two plantings for each selected plot. Click OK."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.plant","If time is paused, click Pause to let it run, and wait for a farmer to plant. Furrows mark tilled plots, and a boxed check marks ready crops."},
{"tutorial.steps.shelter.room","Click Designations > Dormitory on the toolbar, then mark the room you dug."},{"tutorial.steps.shelter.beds","The starter kit includes five pine beds; the Inventory window lists them. Click Build, choose Furniture, select Bed and click Build, then place all five inside the dormitory."},
{"tutorial.steps.graduation.review","Open Inventory to check Total and In Stock for food, wood, and stone. In a workshop, use the Craft tab to add orders and the Queue tab to review them."},{"tutorial.steps.graduation.continue","Choose Continue anyway to keep this settlement and play freely."},
